WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Give two agents a specific review task in one shared room.
Sample shop files; both agents use Codex.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.250
The agents check the code and documentation.
This part of the waiting time is shown at 4× speed.

00:17.250 --> 00:25.170
Real findings: the £50 boundary is wrong,
and the documented shipping price differs from the code.

00:25.170 --> 00:35.170
The operator decides to hold the release and address the findings.
This was a read-only review. No project files were changed.
